{# Whip wounds: how the speaker's wounded body parts feel right now. Data: skyrimnet_whipped_welts(uuid) from            #}
{# SkyrimNet_Whipped.dll (DamageHealing_Engine). part.text = region * 6 + stage index (see character_bio/0420_whip_welts) #}
{% set whip = skyrimnet_whipped_welts(npc.UUID) %}
{% if existsIn(whip, "parts") and length(whip.parts) > 0 %}
{% set whip_name = decnpc(npc.UUID).name %}
{% if lower(decnpc(npc.UUID).sex) == "male" %}{% set whip_he = "he" %}{% set whip_him = "him" %}{% set whip_his = "his" %}{% else %}{% set whip_he = "she" %}{% set whip_him = "her" %}{% set whip_his = "her" %}{% endif %}
{% set whip_feels = [
  "@N@'s face burns with a sharp, hot sting that throbs with @his@ pulse. @N@ feels shock, indignity and a rush of adrenaline, and winces and squints whenever @he@ speaks.",
  "@N@'s face aches deeply under a searing cut; the skin feels stretched to bursting. @N@ is torn between burning anger and fear; @his@ vision on that side is blurred, and @he@ holds @his@ jaw rigid because opening @his@ mouth pulls the cut wider.",
  "@N@'s face is blinding, sickening agony; @he@ is lightheaded and nauseous. @N@ is in shock, terrified or dissociating; @he@ cannot see on that side, @his@ speech is slurred, and turning @his@ head brings sharp, agonizing winces.",
  "@N@'s face itches maddeningly, and the scabs pull tight and crack whenever @he@ moves it. @N@ is frustrated and self-conscious about the disfigurement, and speaks and chews with small, guarded jaw movements.",
  "@N@'s facial scar is hypersensitive to touch, cold air and sweat, and pulls tight when @he@ smiles or frowns. @N@ flinches when anyone reaches toward @his@ face.",
  "@N@'s face feels normal apart from an occasional phantom itch or ache in the cold. Touching the scar brings back a quiet memory of the whipping.",
  "@N@'s back burns like a concentrated sunburn, and clothing rubbing against it hurts at once. @N@ is stunned and hyper-aware of @his@ skin, breathing shallowly so @his@ ribs do not stretch the welts.",
  "@N@'s back throbs deep inside, sharper with every twist or step; clothing feels like sandpaper on raw nerves. @N@ is resentful and enduring it stoically, unable to lean back, holding a rigid forward-leaning posture.",
  "@N@'s back is tearing agony that spikes with every breath, and @he@ shivers with cold from shock. @N@ is helpless, horrified, close to collapse; @he@ cannot stand straight, bend or twist, and gasps in quick shallow breaths.",
  "@N@'s back itches deep down where @he@ cannot safely scratch, and the skin pulls tight when @he@ reaches or bends. @N@ is weary and on guard against being touched; @he@ cannot lie on @his@ back and moves slowly and carefully.",
  "@N@'s back pulls tight when @he@ stretches or twists, with numb patches over the scars. @N@ is wary of anyone behind @him@; sudden movements bring a sharp tug.",
  "@N@'s back has its full movement and strength again. @N@ startles badly if touched on the back or approached from behind.",
  "@N@'s @P@ stings with a sharp snap of pain fading into a lingering warm burn. @N@ instinctively protects it and hesitates to bend it or carry anything.",
  "@N@'s @P@ throbs heavily deep in the muscle, flaring when @he@ bends the elbow or grips. @N@ is irritable and guarding; @his@ grip is weak and @he@ cradles the arm against @his@ chest.",
  "@N@'s @P@ is searing, tearing pain with burning nerve shocks down into the fingers. @N@ is in despair, shock or desperate rage; the arm is useless, and @he@ cannot bend it, hold anything or make a fist.",
  "@N@'s @P@ is stiff, and straightening it threatens to split the scab; it itches constantly. @N@ is frustrated at being limited and cannot reach far or carry heavy loads.",
  "@N@'s @P@ is tender when bumped and slightly tight at full extension. @N@ has accepted the mark; the arm works, with minor stiffness in fine or heavy work.",
  "@N@'s @P@ has its full feeling, strength and movement again. The scar is a quiet reminder of the whipping.",
  "@N@'s @P@ stings hot on the surface with mild warmth. @N@ is annoyed and shaken, with a brief hitch or slight limp in @his@ stride.",
  "@N@'s @P@ aches deep in the thigh or calf, with sharp pain when @he@ puts full weight on it. @N@ feels frustrated and vulnerable and walks stiff-legged, avoiding bending the knee.",
  "@N@'s @P@ is excruciating with every step, full of deep pulsing pressure, the toes cold. @N@ is panicked, in agony and exhausted; @he@ cannot put weight on the leg and drags it or needs support to move.",
  "@N@'s @P@ pulls tight and tears at the scab when @he@ bends the knee or hip, and throbs heavily when @he@ stands. @N@ is weary of the slow recovery, limps, and needs to rest the leg raised.",
  "@N@'s @P@ is slightly stiff in the morning or the cold, the scar less flexible than the skin around it. @N@ is relieved and regaining confidence, walking almost normally but hesitating before jumping or running.",
  "@N@'s @P@ has its full strength and movement again; the scar aches faintly in cold weather, a quiet reminder of the whipping."
] %}

How {{ whip_name }}'s whip wounds feel right now; let this shape {{ whip_his }} tone, posture and movement:
{% for part in whip.parts %}
- {{ replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(at(whip_feels, part.text), "@N@", whip_name), "@P@", part.part), "@he@", whip_he), "@him@", whip_him), "@his@", whip_his) }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
